@startuml
title Project P8 - Domain & Conceptual Model
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Circuit {
  +String circuitName
  +List<Port> ports
  +List<GateNode> nodes
  +List<Connection> connections
  +Boolean isValid()
}

class Port {
  +String name
  +String direction
  +Integer width
}

class GateNode {
  +String nodeId
  +String gateType
  +Integer markerId
  +List<Pin> inputPins
  +Pin outputPin
}

class Pin {
  +String pinName
  +String terminalType
}

class Connection {
  +String sourceEndpoint
  +String targetEndpoint
  +String netName
}

Circuit "1" *-- "many" Port
Circuit "1" *-- "many" GateNode
GateNode "1" *-- "many" Pin
Circuit "1" *-- "many" Connection

note bottom of Circuit
  Gaps & Assumptions:
  - Width is strictly 1 bit (STD_LOGIC).
  - Max 8 GateNodes per circuit.
  - No feedback loops allowed (DAG).
end note
@enduml
